                "fallback": "Marylise Simon - Lyon, Auvergne-Rhône-Alpes, France | Professional Profile | LinkedIn",
                "text": ":speech_balloon: How does one build a strong, consistent, and engaging brand in a fast-moving environment?\n:dart: How does one create content that drives connection, visibility… and results?\n:bar_chart: How does one combine global strategy, operational excellence, and a data-driven mindset?\n\nFor over 10 years, I’ve been supporting B2B and B2C brands in their strategic and creative development. I’ve led international rebranding projects, built brand platforms, designed multichannel digital campaigns, and orchestrated engaging content (web, social media, video…).\n\nMy approach is both creative and structured, grounded in user insight, performance data, and collaborative execution. I thrive on bringing useful, accessible, high-impact brands to life – for clients, teams, and the broader ecosystem. · Location: Lyon. 500+ connections on LinkedIn. View Marylise Simon’s profile on LinkedIn, a professional community of 1 billion members.",
